        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey. I really like what you guys are doing at GTG. By far, SotM is the greatest game, of all time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I was wondering if I could ask a favor. I have a card I&#39;ve been working on creating for my girlfriend for a bit now and am currently working on the front. I&#39;ve run into a problem though. I can&#39;t seem to get a quality image of the back art of the card, even scanning it. I have one in mind, but I&#39;m hesitant to say which one out loud (I know that she is probably reading this at some point).&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, I ask, or beg if you would like, would it be possible to get a .png or something of the back of a certain deck?</p>",
